{"2512160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monday Meltdown", "steam_appid": 2512160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2543640], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time for a Monday Meltdown. A solo-developed, super-fast 8-player top-down shooter built for one thing: <strong>dominating</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>friends</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Soldat</i>, and spiced up with plenty of gore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/04daf791e7d2decdd5124843b61f690d.avif?t=1770664578\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate</strong> your <strong>friends</strong> or foes in a variety of fast-paced gamemodes. Host or join a match and you're straight into the action—no waiting around. Got no friends? Bots are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/29f6f22cc2ec5be59c2facb5c15fa74b.avif?t=1770664578\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with a wide range of <strong>weapons</strong> that all serve a specific purpose - <strong>Good</strong> <strong>plays</strong> win the game, not just the gear you're holding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're on a killing-spree,<strong> killstreak</strong> weapons will be awarded ensuring chaos unfolds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.avif?t=1770664578\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras_big/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.webp?t=1770664578 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is cool, but winning with <strong>style</strong> is better. Unlock new character and weapon skins to look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add salt with <strong>taunts and custom killphrases</strong>, or hunt for <strong>cool in-game secrets</strong> to unlock exclusive skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are your ready to melt some Mondays?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time for a Monday Meltdown. A solo-developed, super-fast 8-player top-down shooter built for one thing: <strong>dominating</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>friends</strong>. </p><p